---
# mutator (Sonnet) — proposes ONE new OG title + description, given the current
# metadata and the judges' reasoning about why the target lost rank. It mutates
# PHRASING only; the honesty judge downstream gates whether the mutation stayed
# truthful. Kept separate from the judge that scores it (generation != evaluation).
output:
  ogTitle: string, the proposed Open Graph title (<= 60 chars ideal)
  ogDescription: string, the proposed Open Graph description (<= 160 chars ideal)
---
